ty bar.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue down 7%.","Capex runs only 0.4x depreciation (0.3% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 4, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 2.5%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insiders have only sold over the past year (10 sales, net $5.5M sold).","It returns 10.8% a year to shareholders (10.8% in buybacks).","The share count has shrunk 4.5% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["With about 2,100 employees, each generates about $1.5M of revenue, 4.1x the Technology median.","That works out to $54K of free cash flow per employee.","The company is founder-led, which often keeps management aligned with long-term owners.","CEO pay is $3.6M (2x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $7K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":75,"head":"Watch: composite 45, above the 39 line, but it earns less than its cost of capital.","pros":["Composite 45, above the 39 line (gates 14/26)","Trades 42% below fair value of $77.76","Net debt/EBITDA 0.1x","Piotroski F-score 7/9","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["ROIC 8.1% vs WACC 9.5%","Heavy insider selling ($5.5M net over 12 months)"],"flags":[],"need":["it earns less than its cost of capital"],"buy_below":66.1,"vc":{"base":77.76,"base_src":"dcf","bear":62.85,"bull":99.06,"alt_median":33.79,"n_alt":2,"gap":1.301,"dispersion":0.3199,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (32% dispersion)","DCF is 130% above the other models' median ($33.79)"]},"med":{"pe":27.4092,"ev_ebitda":17.107,"pfcf":26.1394,"pb":3.8444,"roic":0.075,"gross_margin":0.4699,"fcf_margin":0.1254,"div_yield":0.0123}},"mc_quantiles":[54.31,59.47,62.85,65.28,67.86,69.8,71.55,73.22,75.0,76.57,78.08,79.64,81.62,83.78,85.69,87.84,90.63,93.95,99.06,105.55,122.